@startuml Admin Login
title Admin Desktop App Login with Google

actor Admin
participant "Admin App" as AdminApp
participant "Google OAuth" as Google
participant "API Backend" as API
participant "Database" as DB

Admin -> AdminApp: Open admin app
AdminApp -> Admin: Display login screen
Admin -> AdminApp: Click "Sign in with Google"
AdminApp -> Google: Request Google authentication
Google -> Admin: Show Google login screen
Admin -> Google: Enter credentials
Google -> AdminApp: Return valid ID token

AdminApp -> API: POST /api/auth/login/google\n{id_token}
API -> Google: Verify ID token
Google -> API: Token valid, return user info
API -> DB: Find user by Google sub
DB -> API: User found
API -> API: Validate admin privileges
API -> API: Generate access token
API -> API: Generate refresh token
API -> DB: Store refresh token
API -> AdminApp: Return {access_token, refresh_token}

AdminApp -> AdminApp: Store JWT token
AdminApp -> Admin: Display admin panel

@enduml
